   "assumption": "Traffic consists of the nine onboarded families and nothing else, in the proportions of the demo's mixed capture (scripts/p6-build-packs.sh). Two of its pools are OURS, not corpus: the worked trace's Squid sample and the synthetic 11-slot Squid family built to show propagation. Coverage reaches ~100 % by construction; it shows the cost side of the curve and the one place propagation acts, and it is not evidence about live traffic.",
